                 ControlStyles.ResizeRedraw | ControlStyles.ContainerControl | 
                 ControlStyles.OptimizedDoubleBuffer, true);
   ```

3. **Custom Button Class**: Since standard .NET WinForms buttons do not expose a public `DoubleBuffered` property, you may need to create a derived class from `System.Windows.Forms.Button` and enable double buffering in its constructor.

   ```csharp
